This repository includes a subset of the Franka Emika Panda model from
MuJoCo Menagerie under Apache 2.0. The model license, source revision, and
scene-builder changes are recorded under projects/robofactory_lift/assets/panda/.

The RoboFactory recordings are downloaded from the publisher. Dataset sources
and annotation methods are recorded in each project's README or data directory.
Historical projects retain their own NOTICE files.
